1
00:00:05,000 --> 00:00:08,038
Dodo: Hi, little explorers! I'm Dodo!

2
00:00:08,288 --> 00:00:11,314
Dini: And I'm Dini! Dino-hello!

3
00:00:11,564 --> 00:00:15,138
Dodo: Today we are going to count from one to twenty!

4
00:00:15,388 --> 00:00:18,433
Dini: Twenty? That's so many! Let's go!

5
00:00:19,583 --> 00:00:21,349
Dodo: Let's count the blocks!

6
00:00:21,599 --> 00:00:25,219
Dodo: One, two, three, four, five!

7
00:00:25,469 --> 00:00:28,738
Dini: Five blocks! I counted with you!

8
00:00:28,988 --> 00:00:31,171
Dodo: Can you show me five fingers?

9
00:00:34,171 --> 00:00:37,160
Dodo: Now let's count yummy apples!

10
00:00:37,410 --> 00:00:40,971
Dodo: Six, seven, eight, nine, ten!

11
00:00:41,221 --> 00:00:43,770
Dini: Ten apples! Crunch, crunch!

12
00:00:44,020 --> 00:00:51,450
Dodo: Can you count to ten with me? One, two, three, four, five, six, seven, eight, nine, ten!

13
00:00:53,250 --> 00:00:55,089
Dodo: Look at all the balloons!

14
00:00:55,339 --> 00:00:58,915
Dodo: Eleven, twelve, thirteen, fourteen, fifteen!

15
00:00:59,165 --> 00:01:02,352
Dini: Fifteen balloons! Pop, pop, pop!

16
00:01:02,602 --> 00:01:05,875
Dodo: Oh no, Dini! Let's not pop them!

17
00:01:07,025 --> 00:01:09,041
Dodo: Here come the little ducklings!

18
00:01:09,291 --> 00:01:13,675
Dodo: Sixteen, seventeen, eighteen, nineteen...

19
00:01:14,825 --> 00:01:20,512
Dini: Um, Dodo, what comes after nineteen? Is it eleventy?

20
00:01:20,762 --> 00:01:24,202
Dodo: Ha ha! After nineteen comes twenty!

21
00:01:24,452 --> 00:01:27,151
Dini: Twenty ducklings! Quack, quack!

22
00:01:28,301 --> 00:01:30,641
Dodo: We counted all the way to twenty!

23
00:01:30,891 --> 00:01:33,624
Dini: Hooray! Dino-wow!

24
00:01:34,774 --> 00:01:38,331
Dodo: Let's play a counting game! How many dots do you see?

25
00:01:38,581 --> 00:01:40,092
Dodo: How many dots?

26
00:01:42,192 --> 00:01:42,813
Dini: Three!

27
00:01:43,313 --> 00:01:44,665
Dodo: How many dots?

28
00:01:46,765 --> 00:01:47,443
Dini: Five!

29
00:01:47,943 --> 00:01:49,335
Dodo: How many dots?

30
00:01:51,435 --> 00:01:51,921
Dini: Eight!

31
00:01:52,421 --> 00:01:53,628
Dodo: How many dots?

32
00:01:55,728 --> 00:01:56,422
Dini: Ten!

33
00:01:57,822 --> 00:02:00,471
Dodo: Now let's count to twenty together!

34
00:02:00,771 --> 00:02:06,932
Dodo: One, two, three, four, five, six, seven, eight, nine, ten!

35
00:02:07,182 --> 00:02:15,843
Dini: Eleven, twelve, thirteen, fourteen, fifteen, sixteen, seventeen, eighteen, nineteen, twenty!

36
00:02:16,993 --> 00:02:19,568
Dodo: Great counting, little explorers!

37
00:02:19,818 --> 00:02:22,131
Dini: You are super counters!

38
00:02:23,281 --> 00:02:26,259
Dodo: Share this video with a friend who loves counting!

39
00:02:26,509 --> 00:02:29,126
Dodo & Dini: See you next time, little explorers!

